# Theme artwork

- When creating a built-in theme, always ask Gary to supply its tile image before completing it.
- Never invent, generate, or substitute fallback theme artwork.
- Theme bundles require a valid supplied image. Tile aspect ratio is 2:1; recommended artwork is 1200 × 600 px.
